  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Previously, if a group had an event that was currently ongoing or upcoming soon, a section was created in the group's instances tab and any linked instances would appear in that section. This section always floated to the top of the instances tab and was \"pinned\" there for maximum visibility. \n\nRecently, a change was made such that this section still exists, but no longer always appears at the top of the instances list. Instead, it is mixed in with other sections that show where your friends are in group instances.\n\nI believe this is unintentional. When looking at a group's instances tab, event sections should always be pinned to the top of the list rather than mixed in.",
